    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flātūra</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		flo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				blowing</i> (post-Aug. and very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ventos jamdiu non esse, et caeli conquievisse
					flaturas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 1, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aeris,</span>”
				<i>a melting</i>, <i>coining</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2,
					7 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					7, 56, 57, § 197</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ARGENTARIAE,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4217</span></i>
			.</div>
